k Hamill","role":"Merlin (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zMQ93JTLW8KxusKhOlHFZhih3YQ.jpg"},{"id":20305,"name":"Christopher Roberts","role":"Lt. Roberts - Rescue & Recovery Pilot","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wGhoOU0c0Pp7JAkvcJu8hRHKdH.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Wing Commander - Attacco alla Terra","overview":"I bellicosi alieni Kilrathi assaltano l'avamposto terrestre Pegasus, riuscendo ad entrare in possesso di un sistema di navigazione con le mappe per giungere fino alla Terra.\r Christopher Blair, un giovane pilota assegnato alla TCS Tiger Claw, con il resto della squadra svolge delle missioni per guadagnare tempo in modo da consentire alla flotta della Confederazione di preparare una linea di difesa per la Terra e fermare l'invasione dei Kilrathi.","tagline":"Al loro arrivo l'universo non sarà più lo stesso."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"In the mid-27th century, the Terran Confederation is at war with the vicious alien Kilrathi Empire. When the Kilrathi capture a crucial navigational device that could lead them to Earth, the Confederation’s only hope rests with a small group of young fighter pilots. Lieutenant Christopher Blair, along with his wingman Todd 'Maniac' Marshall and Commander Jeanette 'Angel' Deveraux, must intercept the alien fleet and prevent the destruction of mankind. Battling overwhelming odds and racing against time, they face not only external threats but also inner fears and rivalries as they fight to save Earth from annihilation.","tagline":"At the edge of our universe, all hell is about to break loose."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bHZIfYhJYljATZmVFRr0al2Y4F0.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bHZIfYhJYljATZmVFRr0al2Y4F0.png","language":"it","width":870,"height":200},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jV5i1SFBaCSvCvkHNLFZ1H